---
import '../../styles/global.css';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="description" content="Privacy policy for Little Depths, an offline single-player game." />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#0d1117" />
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://michal.mikusik.art/games/privacy-policy" />
    <title>Little Depths Privacy Policy</title>
  </head>
  <body class="policy-site">
    <header class="site-header">
      <div class="policy-header">
        <span class="policy-mark" aria-hidden="true">M</span>
        <strong>Little Depths</strong>
        <span class="policy-divider" aria-hidden="true">/</span>
        <span>Privacy Policy</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main class="policy-main">
      <p class="policy-kicker">LITTLE DEPTHS</p>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="policy-updated">Last updated: November 17, 2026</p>

      <section>
        <h2>An offline game</h2>
        <p>Little Depths is a single-player game. It has no accounts, advertising, analytics, tracking, in-app purchases, or online services. The app does not collect, transmit, sell, or share personal data. It does not request Internet, location, camera, microphone, contacts, or shared-storage access.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Data kept on your device</h2>
        <p>Game progress, your chosen difficulty, submarine fleet, in-game currency, crew-return timestamps, and settings are stored in the app's private storage on your device. In-game currency is fictional and cannot be purchased or exchanged for real money. The game reads the device clock to calculate crew returns. These values are not sent to the developer.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Backups and deletion</h2>
        <p>The app disables Android automatic backup and does not provide cloud saves. Starting a new game replaces campaign progress. You can delete all local progress and settings by clearing the app's storage in Android Settings or uninstalling it. Device manufacturers may provide their own transfer tools, which are governed by their policies.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Children and third parties</h2>
        <p>The same offline, no-collection behavior applies to all players. The app does not integrate third-party advertising, analytics, social, or payment SDKs. Google Play and your device operating system may process their own installation, purchase, diagnostics, or device data under their respective policies; the developer does not receive that data through this app.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Changes and contact</h2>
        <p>A later release may update this policy if the app's behavior changes. For privacy questions, contact the developer using the Developer contact information on Little Depths' Google Play listing.</p>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="policy-footer">© Michal · Little Depths</footer>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  .policy-site { min-height: 100vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  .policy-header { max-width: 960px; width: 100%; height: 64px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin: auto; padding: 0 24px; color: #c9d1d9; }
  .policy-mark { width: 30px; height: 30px; display: grid; place-items: center; border-radius: 50%; background: #e6edf3; color: #161b22; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 800; }
  .policy-divider { color: #7d8590; }
  .policy-main { width: min(100% - 40px, 760px); flex: 1; margin: 0 auto; padding: 56px 0 72px; }
  .policy-kicker { color: #79c0ff; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: .08em; }
  .policy-main h1 { margin-top: 10px; font-size: clamp(30px, 6vw, 40px); font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.2; }
  .policy-updated { margin-top: 12px; color: #8b949e; }
  .policy-main section { margin-top: 32px; }
  .policy-main h2 { margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; }
  .policy-main section p { color: #c9d1d9; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.8; }
  .policy-footer { width: min(100% - 40px, 960px); margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px 0 32px; border-top: 1px solid #30363d; color: #8b949e; font-size: 12px; }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .policy-header { height: 60px; padding-inline: 20px; }
    .policy-main { padding-top: 40px; }
  }
</style>
